title: StartScript

---
Thepromeus: I once knew somebody.
Thepromeus: A girl, with a bright smile and determination that could bring the world down.
Thepromeus: The girl, lost in her own mind, had big dreams for the future.
Thepromeus: But unfortunately the future that holded her was a bleek one.
Thepromeus: Towering gigants were build, the greenery of the ground that once was had been replaced with metal and cooper.
Thepromeus: All that once was organic had been replaced by components.
Thepromeus: This girl. Decided to opose the gigants.
Thepromeus: She was a tall leader despite her age, she made the weak rally.
Thepromeus: She promised "We will bring the fire to them, so they may feel what we feel everyday of our existence"
Thepromeus: She didn't have a plan, well maybe one.
Thepromeus: To keep dreaming, and to spread hope to all.
Thepromeus: That they weren't alone, and that together they might take the world from the powers that be.
Thepromeus: Perhaps then, that's why they got rid of her.
Thepromeus: A shame, I liked the talkings off this little soul.
Thepromeus: Maybe it's cause we didn't think that those who were born in the metal age had this passion for the world that once was.
        ->You: You are talking about me, right?
Thepromeus: Dreams, that word. too big for your own good.
Thepromeus: Desires, Too unstable, too many variables for them.
Thepromeus: That's why they decided to put you in a little caccon.
Thepromeus: Like the rest of them.
Thepromeus: I pitty you. 
Thepromeus: At least you don't get to remember how we suffered.
Thepromeus: Farewell young one.
Thepromeus: Trust only your soul.
Thepromeus: Godspeed.
You: ...
Eagle: It's cold here.
Eagle: You can't feel anything.
Echo: You can't hear anything.
Eagle: Have you perished? No... A lost soul would not have been able to gather thought...
Solitude: Is this all there is? All we have in this life? 
Solitude: Are we stuck in limbo for the rest of our life?
Solitude: can't you see? this is all there is to our existence.
Vanity: Lies, all of this.
Vanity: Us, what we are, we could never end up on a place like this.
Vanity: We are the ultimate being, we were not born to spend our lifes in Darkness.
Eagle: Let us focus then.
Eagle: Let's regain control.
Solitude: Let's 
Vanity: Let's
Echo: Let's
Vanity: Let's
Eagle: Let's
Lust: Let's
Eagle: View
Solitude: Dread
Echo: Sound
Solitude: Fright
Vanity: Distress
Judgement: Responsability
Lust: Desire
Vanity: Meaning
Eagle: Canvas
Solitude: Death
Vanity: life
Solitude: Seclusion
Vanity: Learning
Lust: Copulation
Eyes: Us
Eyes: You
<<jump OutofPod>>
===
title: OutofPod
---
Voice: Hey, hello?
Echo: A loud mechanical sound emanates from your current position.
Eagle: The light penetrates through. We appear to be seated on a white Spherical machine.
Eagle: Air and gas releases from the machine.
Voice: Okay... here we go...
Echo: Individual, I hear an Individual.
Echo: Their tone androgynous. Their way of speaking, soft they want us to calm down.
Judgement: Do we speak a word, Vessel?
Judgement: Yes, I refer to you...

    ->Speak up
        <<jump Speakup>>
    ->Say nothing
        <<jump Saynothing>>

===
title: Speakup
---
Judgement: A Choice has been taken.
Echo: You let out a sound, a feeble moan that echoes through the small sphere.
Solitude: Please hear us, please save us. This mortal body can only live for so long
Vanity: Pathetic, Open this machine, rip it off it's components and regain composture.
Solitude: Do not hear, we are at the disadvantage, we are lost. Pray for survival.
Eagle: you can see the shadow of the Individual, aproaching slowly.


===
title: Saynothing
---
Judgement: A Choice has been taken.
Echo: Only the sounds of the machine opening fill the area you are in.
Vanity: Good, we do not fright in moments like this, let them aproach you. Let them know you are in control.
Solitude: Your arrogance will be our end. 
Vanity: Do not listen, soon, after we free ourselfs from this prision we will ascend.
Eagle: you can see the shadow of the Individual, aproaching slowly
===

title: OutofPod2
---
Voice: Okay, You are okay. Good... Good...
Kala: My name is Kala. Can you hear me okay? How are you feeling?
Echo: The dreaded Individual shares a piece of her Identity with us.
Eagle: You see this... Kala, They are standing in front of you with a cluster of papers on their hands.
Lust: You can not control yourself, you analyze their body from head to bottom
Lust: Their face is beautiful, the way their hair is tied on the back of their head, makes you curious.
Lust: Their figure is hidden due to a large coat covering their body.
Lust: Yet you can still see their silhouette. Thin, Curved, Well shaped.
Lust: Their body leaves a lot to the imagination.  
Eagle: There is a circular symbol on it. A logo, remember it. It may be important.
Eagle: Observing the room you find yourself on an old house full of electronic components.
Eagle: Nothing is oganized and you can't tell what's natural and what are electronic components.
Eagle: You can't even tell if it's day or night.
Echo: The machine stops.
Vanity: The time for questions has come.
Judgement: Let's begin then.
Judgement: Vessel?

->Where am I?
        <<jump Whereami>>

->Who am I?
        <<jump whoami>>

->Who are you?
        <<jump whoareyou>>
===
title: Whereami
---
Judgement: A Choice has been taken.
Kala: You are in my house.
Kala: I will answer all your questions in due time.
Kala: Please try to take it slow. This can be very overwhelming sometimes.
===
title: whoami
---
