Eagle: They grab a few papers
Dejavu: All this talk of tests stir something from inside of you.
Dejavu: You head starts pulsating, you feel dizzy and for a few seconds you are somewhere else.
 ->You: What is happening to me?
Dejavu: It seems echoes from another life have come back to hunt you.
