Middle aged man 2: Listen, We are not playing any fucking games here.
Middle aged man 2: We saw you at the riot, and we have several witnesses that confirmed that you orchestrated it.
Middle aged man 2: Just because you are young doesn't mean we are gonna go easy on you.
Middle aged man 1: Please do not make us use any... unnecessary violence...
Eagle: The man to your left show's you a button, it's cables lead to the chair you are sitting on.
Eagle: This is an electric chair... You are being tested...
