Middle aged man 2: Wrong choice.
Eagle: The man, after a few a few moments of hesitation presses the button.
Eagle: A high charge of electricity furiously transits your body. From head to toe. an agresive wave of needles claw to your back.
Eagle: You become light headed again.
Middle aged man 1: Please stay cognizant during the interrogation.
Vanity: The nerve from this whale looking, idiotic fascist. Stand up straight. Show him that didn't nearly hit you.
Middle aged man 2: Good. You seem less flimsy than you look.
Middle aged man 2: Jesus. How did someone so young rally a group of people like this?
Middle aged man 1: It seems the commonwealth of Stelora don't value a strong leader, Officer.
Echo: Stelora. 
Eagle: Visions of this city comes to you. A city full of culture and advancements. 
Eagle: A city you spend every single moment since the day you were born.
Vanity: Yet you can't remember a single thing about it's streets. 
Vanity: What a great Stelorian you are. 
Middle aged man 1: Officer, We are receving a call. 
Middle aged man 1: We will come back to her later.
Middle aged man 2: Alright. 


